01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251212/1076117019721469952943581.jpeg/rFDUxu9Q1c5LZAt_w816saQCNGCnjEp7aUJS8WlCUvE\"/><figcaption>培育鑽石因其高CP值吸引許多內地年輕人青睞。（YouTube@TVBSNEWS01）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"培育鑽石因其高CP值吸引許多內地年輕人青睞。（YouTube@TVBSNEWS01）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251212/1076117022120742912830154.jpeg/VY6W_p6PB33cgzSxae_weTRXulPnxKDdV-vi1Ffr4tQ\"/><figcaption>培育鑽石因其高CP值吸引許多內地年輕人青睞。（YouTube@TVBSNEWS01）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"培育鑽石因其高CP值吸引許多內地年輕人青睞。（YouTube@TVBSNEWS01）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251212/1076117024289329152192357.jpeg/EPB3qt97fKDFPJt54ndDe2JK3FhgpHAgOKf9Fjin_RY\"/><figcaption>培育鑽石因其高CP值吸引許多內地年輕人青睞。（YouTube@TVBSNEWS01）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"培育鑽石因其高CP值吸引許多內地年輕人青睞。（YouTube@TVBSNEWS01）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251212/1076117026386612224815642.jpeg/fRVLzZ3Wi9EufCBf6Lw8kd7APeKyTDmOQ9xaPUPcWj0\"/><figcaption>培育鑽石因其高CP值吸引許多內地年輕人青睞。（YouTube@TVBSNEWS01）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"培育鑽石因其高CP值吸引許多內地年輕人青睞。（YouTube@TVBSNEWS01）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251212/1076117028534226944720158.jpeg/9CoHEtI9wNd6EmokvlKeFCiu2ZCMDEpiMCavsDAmr7A\"/><figcaption>培育鑽石因其高CP值吸引許多內地年輕人青睞。（YouTube@TVBSNEWS01）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"培育鑽石因其高CP值吸引許多內地年輕人青睞。（YouTube@TVBSNEWS01）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251212/1076117015527165952384905.jpeg/sA-r80YbL_ZG-kRJVPDntsLoq2JeV4wuMpEMZTKRDGU\"/><figcaption>培育鑽石因其高CP值吸引許多內地年輕人青睞。（YouTube@TVBSNEWS01）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"培育鑽石因其高CP值吸引許多內地年輕人青睞。（YouTube@TVBSNEWS01）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251212/1076117017821581312358209.jpeg/iPYC00FPyLC7YsEL4isYb0iDdfEMvYMHMfA8-THwPPk\"/><figcaption>培育鑽石因其高CP值吸引許多內地年輕人青睞。（YouTube@TVBSNEWS01）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"培育鑽石因其高CP值吸引許多內地年輕人青睞。（央視新聞）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251212/1076118069119553536129783.png/KEZUXs6QwCjin3GlGPIXR_jWiHIkfjrUeVUU93lVFPc\"/><figcaption>培育鑽石因其高CP值吸引許多內地年輕人青睞。（央視新聞）</figcaption></figure><p>延伸閲讀：</p><p>越南買鑽石恐踩雷 消費者急求回購！3萬顆走私鑽 鑑定等級疑遭灌水</p><p>Lisa最愛！寶格麗頂級珠寶展 全球唯一祖母綠項鍊、超薄三問腕表登台</p><p>【本文獲「聯合新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-05T10:20:30.306564+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1479,"images":20,"source":"HK01 國際","fallback":"none"}}